WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:03.170
Docking Operation!

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:11.680
Watch out!

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:22.190
This can't be.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.900
No way. Impossible! Unthinkable!

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.200
There's no way this could happen.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.370
Seriously, monsters? Attacking the Manifestor Engine?

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.000
What's that?

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.000
A person?

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.390
Vividblue Operation!

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:24.610
Isshiki Akane and Futaba Aoi successfully Docked, forming Vividblue.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:27.360
They then used Vivid Impact to destroy the Alone.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:34.120
At that point, Blue Island's alert level was lowered from three back to one.

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:37.830
Our forces are currently attempting to recover samples of the Alone.

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.880
Phew. That chilled me to the bone.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:46.840
<i>Is that really Dr. Isshiki Kenjirou, inventor of the Manifestor Engine?</i>

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:49.340
We asked you to come here today because we've found evidence

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:55.850
that someone has recently been stealing confidential data regarding the Alones.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:59.440
They managed to break through the Bureau's firewalls.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:01.190
What?!

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:09.570
Another nice throw today, Akane!

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.200
Good morning, Mrs. Suzuki!

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:19.460
Huh?

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:23.460
We were wide open?

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.460
Right when you were about to Dock.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:28.680
It was a good thing I made it in time.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:29.910
Ah...

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.420
Yeah, that was a really close call.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:36.180
I think we need to work on our defense.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:37.730
So...

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.650
This is a traditional Natural Harmony School training exercise!

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:47.150
Don't just dodge! Repel them!

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:49.490
Th-That's easier said than done!

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:50.910
Here!

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.620
You're up next, Aoi!

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.620
O-Okay!

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:01.380
This is Flotilla 2 to Command. We cannot find any remaining traces of the Alone.

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:04.130
It appears to have completely dissolved.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.340
Copy that. End operation and return to port.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.060
Very well, that's all for today.

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.650
My butt is really sore!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.150
It's okay, Aoi! We're here with you!

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:28.410
Next time, don't think about it! Just feel it!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.320
I'll try...

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.990
PE's next, huh?

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.420
Play ball!

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.960
Let's do this!

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:45.420
Yay!

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.430
Aoi, just focus on the mitt!

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.680
I'll throw it straight at you!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.390
Thanks in advance!

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:57.310
Isshiki, your hands are the wrong way around.

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.320
Strike!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.070
Wakaba, you're awesome!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.410
Strike two!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.210
At last, I can move about.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.920
Heave-ho!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:33.390
I'm surprised that the hacker who broke through my firewalls ended up being in Akane's class.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.640
Who's the culprit?!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.310
In the name of the Natural Harmony School,

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.610
I'll strike you out in three pitches!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.830
A camera?

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:53.580
What's that?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.920
Gotcha!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.050
What was that?

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.480
Home run.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.980
Oh no! Himawari!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.980
What should I do? Himawari!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.530
Calm down, Akane. It's just a camera.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:25.820
I can't glue it together with sticky rice, can I?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.530
Don't worry. I'll come with you to apologize.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.320
I'll come too, Akane.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:34.080
Thanks, you two...

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:34.790
It'll be okay.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.330
That camera...

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.590
Hello!

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.220
Is she out?

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:49.590
Let's go. We can't apologize to someone who's not here.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.260
I'll wait for her to come back.

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.890
I want to apologize as soon as I can.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.310
I'm sure she'll be back before it gets dark.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.650
Geez, are you just gonna stand there forev—

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.650
Come on, she's not even here?

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:06.320
Gramps, what are <i>you</i> doing here?!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.960
Himawari?

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:19.830
Come in.

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:26.340
Isn't it a bit too cold in here?

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.220
It's just the right temperature for my electronics.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:31.260
Oh, so that's why you're sitting under a heated table.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:34.930
Um... I'm really sorry about this.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:40.560
I'll cover the repairs out of my paycheck next month!

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.650
It's okay. I forgive you.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:47.530
Really?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.610
In exchange, show me that stuffed animal of yours.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:51.370
Huh?

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:52.370
What?

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:53.740
U-Uh...

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.410
Well...

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.160
What is this thing?

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:58.250
Well...

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.040
That's, uh...

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.630
It's...

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:01.670
Mr. Fake!
It's...

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:02.380
Mr. Fake!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:03.590
<i>That's so obvious.</i>

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:04.880
<i>Really obvious.</i>

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.130
<i>Painfully obvious.</i>

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:11.970
I wanna see its insides.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:13.470
<i>Please no.</i>

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:18.060
Y-You can't! Mr. Fake is a very important friend of mine!

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:20.310
Friend?

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.070
I don't need friends.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:35.330
Uh... Your room sure is interesting!

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:38.170
Do you like factories?

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:39.960
Kinda.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.880
What's that one on the wall?

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.630
That's the streamer plant.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.930
It sends energy from the Manifestor Engine all around the world.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.430
I see...

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:51.640
Isn't it pretty?

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.060
I guess...

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:58.350
But it looks even better at sunset.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:01.980
Really? I wanna see it!

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:04.150
Hey, let's go there now!

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:05.150
Huh?

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:07.030
I'd love to see it too.

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:09.110
Yeah! And it's so close by!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.320
Let's go, Himawari!

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.950
N-Now?

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:13.830
Yeah!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:16.790
I can't.

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:20.580
Huh? Why? Come on!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:23.710
It's hot outside, there are bugs, and I'd get tired!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:26.300
And it's outside.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:28.510
Come on! Isn't this when it looks the best?

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:30.590
And I've got no clothes.

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:32.680
Clothes?

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:34.470
In that case...

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:42.690
That looks wonderful!

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:44.730
You're cute, Himawari!

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.570
I knew it'd look good on you!

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:48.660
My eyes never betray me!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.950
Where did you get these clothes?

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:50.990
Uh, well...
Where did you get these clothes?

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.660
Uh, well...

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:55.450
Does that really matter?

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:01.170
Your hair's so pretty, Shinomiya.

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:03.050
If you say so.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:05.800
Oh right, I brought these too!

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:10.970
So... So... So cute!

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:16.730
Chest's too tight.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:20.860
Whoa!

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:22.190
It's beautiful!

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:23.650
What a magnificent view.

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:26.280
And it doesn't just <i>look</i> beautiful.

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:31.740
The most beautiful part is that such a gigantic facility can be completely automated.

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.830
I-I guess so...

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:37.290
You must think I sound like a total weirdo.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:40.880
Not at all! I love the Manifestor Engine too!

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:44.170
Don't say things you don't really mean.

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:49.430
Do you really understand how great the Engine is?

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:55.430
Do you really know how much it helps people around the world?

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.560
Shinomiya...

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.400
When I say I love the Engine, I really mean it.

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.230
Don't put me in the same league as you.

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:04.110
But we <i>are</i> the same!

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:10.370
"Science and technology exist to make people happy."

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:13.370
That's what my mom, my dad, and my grandpa always said.

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:15.370
And I agree with them.

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:17.870
That's why we're the same!

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.880
So she really <i>was</i> the one who hacked into our systems.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.590
She's unbelievably gifted, that's for sure.

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:28.800
Though she doesn't hold a candle to me, of course.

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:31.970
Your name was...

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:34.600
Akane! It's Isshiki Akane!

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:37.730
Isshiki? You mean—

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:44.360
An evacuation order?!

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:45.490
Don't tell me...

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:04.710
The streamer plant...

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:14.720
The emergency shutdown device was destroyed...

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:16.850
The energy's flowing out!

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:18.520
We have to stop it right now!

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:19.350
But...

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:23.270
If the streamer plant's destroyed, we won't be able to send energy around the world anymore!

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:26.740
But even then, what can <i>we</i> do to save it?

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.740
I could do it.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:38.750
If I could enter the control module...

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:41.630
I could do something!

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:45.250
Aoi! Wakaba!

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:49.380
Ignition!

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:51.550
Texture on!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:09.570
You three...

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:13.330
I'll take Himawari to the plant.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:15.500
Okay! Leave the rest to us.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:18.830
Take care, Akane!

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:22.670
Come on, let's go!

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:37.310
So you were the ones who were fighting those monsters?

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:39.810
I'll come back for you!

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:41.690
I promise!

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:44.280
Promise...

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:53.490
Naked Blade!

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:59.920
Naked Impact!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.720
Naked Rang!

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.640
Sorry for the wait!

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:16.640
Akane!

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:17.560
You're here!

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:21.900
Isn't this the same Alone we defeated the other day?

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.900
It seems like it's gotten stronger since then.

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:26.610
It must have evolved.

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:32.660
I won't let you go any further!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:37.960
Please! Let me make it in time!

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:49.970
Phew. That was close...

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:06.490
Please, Himawari!

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:09.780
I want to stop them from bullying me.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:15.620
I'm sure they wouldn't do it if they weren't anonymous.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:19.540
But if they find out I did it...

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:22.880
It's okay! We're the only ones who'll know!

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:25.550
Will you keep it secret?

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.800
Yeah! I promise!

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:32.930
That's so mean!

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:34.350
You went too far.

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:36.180
You did it, didn't you?!

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:37.560
You're horrible!

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:40.480
No! It wasn't me!

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:41.690
It was...

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:44.360
Himawari!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.000
You said you'd come back for me...

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:02.630
Promises... Promises really are worthless...

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:07.250
Himawari!

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:13.850
Sorry it took so long!

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:30.160
Why...

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:32.910
Why did you come back?

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:35.290
I promised, didn't I?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.920
You promised...

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:43.920
That's your key, Himawari!

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:51.470
My... key?

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:56.930
Can I do it too?

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:02.440
Can I fight too?

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:05.440
Of course!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:14.910
Ignition!

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.920
Texture on!

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:10.470
Oh no!

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:13.470
It's gonna hit Blue Island!

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:15.810
Naked Collider!

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:34.790
Isn't that...

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:39.960
Shinomiya?

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:41.630
Was that you just then?

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:44.630
She's our new comrade...

00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:47.130
No, our friend!

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:13.990
It powered up!

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:16.000
It's so creepy!

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:17.790
Can you hear me, Akane?

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:18.960
Gramps?

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:22.540
I'm detecting tremendous energy from within its body!

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.880
You have to defeat it quickly, or we'll be in trouble!

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:26.590
But how?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:29.220
Wait a moment. Let me think of something.

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:30.840
It's okay.

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:33.850
We can do it.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.100
Yeah!

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:38.230
Operation...

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:41.230
Vividyellow!

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:09.130
Akane...

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:11.180
and Shinomiya...

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:13.350
Docked?!

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:20.270
Are you telling me she was able to understand the entire Vivid System already?!

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:28.280
Watch out!

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.450
Vivid Collider!

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.160
Whoa...

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.750
Vividengine, release safety!

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:50.220
Vividengine, output at 120%!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:54.430
150%!

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:57.430
200%!

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:02.520
Final Operation!

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:34.510
I had no idea you were Dr. Isshiki Kenjirou's granddaughter.

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:39.100
Though it seems you didn't inherit his genius.

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:40.980
You couldn't even fix my camera.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:44.820
I'd say few people could.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:47.530
Sorry...

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:48.320
It's okay.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:50.820
I don't need it anymore.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:55.040
Tomorrow, I'm going back to school.

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:56.700
Himawari!

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:59.750
Geez, and here I even fixed it for you!

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:01.710
<i>Now</i> you say you don't need it?

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:03.290
Gramps!

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:05.170
You're Dr Isshiki, right?

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:08.430
Very much so! I'm Isshiki Kenjirou!

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:11.930
I've looked up to you for so long!

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:14.600
C-Could I have your autograph?

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:16.890
That's my book, isn't it?

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:18.890
Yes! I love it!

00:22:18.890 --> 00:22:21.440
The way you elaborate about the application of Manifestor Energy

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.150
to the field of synchronous generation...

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:24.530
Uh, Shinomiya?

00:22:25.360 --> 00:22:27.780
I can't understand a word of what she's saying.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:30.570
Himawari, you look like you're having fun.

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:33.870
I'm impressed you figured all that out!

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:36.750
I predict that the orthodox way of—

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:16.600
Kuroki Rei. There is something I must do.

00:24:17.270 --> 00:24:19.850
So I need no friends.

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:23.570
Next time: "Another Key".

00:24:23.570 --> 00:24:25.360
Don't be so nice to me.
